      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.3 Agriculture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ljcznl2",
      "content": "Agriculture is the backbone of Chhattisgarh's rural economy. About 80% of the population is engaged in agriculture directly or indirectly. The state is known as the 'Rice Bowl of India' due to its extensive paddy cultivation."
    },
