    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "088liyp",
      "content": "The state government launched the 'Rajiv Gandhi Kisan Nyay Yojana' to provide income support to farmers. The scheme provides direct benefit transfer (DBT) to farmers for cultivation of paddy, sugarcane, maize, and other crops."
    },
    {
      "id": "ruycs42",
