      "content": "4.4 Industries"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kdb4d7b",
      "content": "Chhattisgarh has emerged as a major industrial hub, especially in the steel, cement, power, and aluminum sectors. Bhilai Steel Plant (BSP), set up with Soviet assistance in 1959, is one of the largest integrated steel plants in Asia."
